  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1740144503_7092027_19dc593ab45c0f6d5e835689c8f50853.png",
  "description": "<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"76\" data-start=\"47\"><strong data-end=\"74\" data-start=\"51\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"77\">At Woodenfactory.dk, we create beautifully crafted wooden designs made with love and attention to detail. Our passion lies in transforming high-quality materials like oak veneer, birch veneer, and walnut veneer into meaningful products that bring warmth and personality into every home. Each piece is thoughtfully designed, laser-cut, and carefully packed, ensuring a premium experience from start to finish.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"519\" data-start=\"489\"><strong data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"493\">Product Description:</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"520\">Our products range from personalized wooden plaques and keepsakes to elegant home decor and functional organizational tools. Every item is crafted from 3mm thick veneered wood, ensuring both durability and a natural aesthetic. Whether it&rsquo;s a custom nameplate, memory board, or decorative item, each design offers a unique way to celebrate special moments or add charm to everyday life.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"909\"><strong data-end=\"944\" data-start=\"913\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"947\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"947\"><strong data-end=\"969\" data-start=\"949\">Personalization:</strong> We offer custom engraving for names, dates, and messages, making each product truly one-of-a-kind.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1071\"><strong data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1073\">High-Quality Materials:</strong> All our designs are made from premium oak, birch, or walnut veneer wood for a sophisticated and timeless look.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1352\" data-start=\"1214\"><strong data-end=\"1242\" data-start=\"1216\">Handcrafted with Care:</strong> Every product is lovingly crafted and packed by hand, ensuring attention to detail and exceptional quality.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1353\"><strong data-end=\"1378\" data-start=\"1355\">Meaningful Gifting:</strong> Our items are perfect for heartfelt gifts&mdash;whether for memorials, special occasions, or simply to bring joy to someone&rsquo;s day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><br></p>",
